WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:07.007
- CALL MY AGENT.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.641
[cell phone ringing]

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.510
- JADEN PINKETT SMITH, MY MAN.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.278
- WHAT UP, CLYDE.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.547
HEY LOOK, MAN, I'M GONNA
BE REAL WITH YOU OKAY?

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.650
THIS "ALIEN BOY" SCRIPT,
I'M NOT FEELIN' IT.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.220
I MEAN, IT'S HARD
BEING WILL SMITH'S SON.

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:23.990
I JUST WANNA MAKE SURE
MY NEXT PROJECT REFLECTS

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.625
THAT I'M A DOWN-TO-EARTH,
NORMAL KID.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.360
AM I MAKING ANY SENSE?

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:29.262
YEAH, YEAH,
I'M READING YOU LOUD AND CLEAR.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:32.198
I'VE GOT A SCRIPT RIGHT HERE.
VERY REAL, CALLED "STREET BALL."

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.334
- TALK TO ME.
- OKAY, SO YOU PLAY TONY.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.036
HE'S A KID FROM THE STREETS,
LIVES IN THE HOOD

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.437
IN A HOUSE
WITH HIS MOM.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:40.173
- STOP.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.174
HOUSE?

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.575
OH, IT'S LIKE A...

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.611
TINY MANSION.
- GOT IT, GO ON.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.513
- SO HIS MOM AND HE,
UH, THEY LIVE IN THIS HOUSE

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.181
AND SHE WORKS
AT A SUPERMARKET.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:49.783
- STOP.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.118
- OH, YEAH, A SUPERMARKET'S
LIKE A MANSION,

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.987
UH, BUT IT'S FULL OF FOOD
AND ANYONE CAN GO THERE.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.423
- SO, LIKE,
WHERE THE BUTLERS GO?

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.324
- YEAH, BASICALLY.
SO HE, UH--

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.826
- AND WAIT.

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:01.561
YOU SAID HIS MOM
WAS DOING SOMETHING

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.163
AT THE SUPERMARKET?

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.698
- WORKING.
- SO...

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.301
- WORKING IS KIND OF LIKE ACTING
ON A SET EVERY DAY

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.103
IN A FILM THAT
NO ONE'S EVER GONNA SEE.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.905
AND IT LASTS
FOR THE REST OF YOUR LIFE.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.673
- OH, LIKE A MAID!

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.275
- YEAH, YEAH, SHE'S LIKE
THE MAID OF THE SUPERMARKET.

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:17.210
- AWESOME, CONTINUE.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:19.546
- SO ANYWAY, TONY DOESN'T
MAKE THE BASKETBALL TEAM, RIGHT?

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.014
SO HE DECIDES TO START
PLAYING PICKUP GAMES

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.715
OF STREET BALL OUTSIDE.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:26.619
- SO HE PLAYS BASKETBALL
IN HIS PLANE?

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.354
- NO, ON THE GROUND.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:29.989
- IN HIS LIMO?

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:31.791
- NO, UH, OUTSIDE
IS THAT STUFF

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.927
THAT GOES BY WHEN
YOU'RE INSIDE THE LIMO.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.495
- OH, SNAP!

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.664
HE PLAYS BASKETBALL
OUTSIDE THE LIMO DOOR?

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:39.232
- YEAH, YEAH,
YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:41.301
SO THEN HE GETS
REALLY GOOD AT BASKETBALL,

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.169
AND THEN BLAH-BLAH
BLAH-BLAH-BLAH, FAST FORWARD.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:46.172
AT THE HEART OF THE STORY TONY
HAS TO CHOOSE BETWEEN HIS MOM--

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:49.309
- CHOOSE.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:51.578
- YEAH, "CHOOSE" IS WHEN
YOU HAVE TO MAKE A DECISION

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.581
BETWEEN TWO THINGS YOU WANT
BUT YOU CAN HAVE ONLY ONE.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.718
- BUT...THERE'S TWO.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:02.288
- YEAH, BUT, I MEAN,
HE CAN'T HAVE BOTH.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:05.391
- [scoffs] WHAT'D I SAY
ABOUT SCIENCE FICTION, CLYDE?

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.293
IT'S A NO.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.929
- OKAY, WE'LL PASS.

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.264
ACHOO!

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.565
- DAD BLESS YOU.
- THANKS.

